// An attribute name that resolves to no registry entry is `UnknownAttribute`,
// rendered with a did-you-mean over the registry (proposal-attributes.md §3.2,
// the ADR-42 unknown-member story). `dco` is one edit from `doc`.
//@ expect-diagnostic: unknown attribute `dco`
//@ expect-diagnostic: did you mean `doc`
@[dco("oops")]
def f = 42;
